      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Port this OpenFGA ReBAC hierarchy + authorization pattern into datalake-api-core.\nRun it side-by-side with real data pulled from the Gold layer (not seeded demo data),\nto validate the model and the tree/per-structure checks against production-shaped data.",
